  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Human Security through Integrated Support for the Most Vulnerable and Crisis-Affected Communities in South Kordofan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to supporting vulnerable and crisis-affected communities in South Kordofan by employing a human security approach and community-based programming and offering lifesaving water, sanitation and hygiene, food and personal security as well as livelihood interventions in an effort to contribute to conflict prevention, while promoting resilience and social cohesion of populations.</narrative>
  </description>
